#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:1
#: 5e5371d20255434792c693de9f718026
msgid "查找疑似非物理结构"
msgstr "Find Suspected Nonphysical Structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:3
#: 030ec4b243494a7593cab5c23bdc9989
msgid "界面按钮：`查找疑似非物理结构`。"
msgstr "Toolbar action: `Find suspected nonphysical structures`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:5
#: 221d8c70e243437d88effbcd6b6953dc
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:7
#: ff279ec477bc4e949eba329a2005dba0
msgid ""
"按近邻距离扫描当前活动结构，选中疑似存在原子重叠或异常短接触的构型。适合检查"
"强扰动、 随机缺陷、表面吸附和随机堆积产生的候选池。"
msgstr "Scan active structures by neighbor distance and select configurations that may contain overlapping atoms or anomalously short contacts. Use it to review candidate pools produced by strong perturbations, random defects, surface adsorption, or random packing."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:10
#: 8c7cded4fb5046b1b302e6d0e55c1156
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:12
#: eca5bd1a1e5c402fb0181e98d2951c59
msgid "对每一对元素 $A,B$，程序用共价半径之和给出元素相关的距离下限："
msgstr "For each element pair $A,B$, the program derives an element-dependent distance limit from the sum of covalent radii:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:14
#: 08b481ce0d844f51aba14503d014997d
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A,B)=c_r\\left[r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(A)+r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(B)"
"\\right],\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A,B)=c_r\\left[r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(A)+r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(B)"
"\\right],\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:18
#: 7170a04cef9248dda1f839a2a2d20d31
msgid ""
"其中 $r_{\\mathrm{cov}}$ 是共价半径，$c_r$ 是界面设置中的半径系数，默认 "
"0.7。 程序在周期边界条件下扫描原子对；只要存在"
msgstr "Here $r_{\\mathrm{cov}}$ is the covalent radius and $c_r$ is the radius coefficient from the interface, default 0.7. The program scans atom pairs under periodic boundary conditions; whenever"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:21
#: bff9af9418dd4f9490913cbd063768d7
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_{ij}<r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A_i,A_j),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_{ij}<r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A_i,A_j),\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:25
#: c02a811dd177486abbe44133569cd96b
msgid ""
"该结构就会被选中。与统一的绝对距离阈值相比，这种判据会随元素尺寸变化，但它仍"
"不知道 键级、压力或特殊化学环境，因此只能称为“疑似非物理”。"
msgstr "the structure is selected. Unlike one universal absolute-distance threshold, this criterion adapts to element size. It still knows nothing about bond order, pressure, or unusual chemical environments, so the result is only a suspected nonphysical structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:28
#: d51ed050e7ef47d2ac21f2c18c44af5e
msgid "判定与结果"
msgstr "Criterion and Result"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7184
#: 41ed7043438d48e9935ff5bb84ae96b1
msgid "参数来源：`widget.radius_coefficient`（默认 `0.7`）。"
msgstr "Parameter source: `widget.radius_coefficient` (default `0.7`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7185
#: e493b94c87424f0b9912977c334ae578
msgid "执行结果：扫描后选中疑似非物理结构。"
msgstr "Result: select structures flagged as potentially nonphysical after the scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:35
#: 1347899b3daf451490ee2431f8b058d0
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:37
#: a3f0a0a5e5914c7f9bdfd006a6050609
msgid ""
"扫描结果只是复核集合，不会自动删除。逐个查看最短键长和局部几何；高压结构或特"
"殊成键体系 可能具有真实的短距离，不能只因被选中就判为坏结构。"
msgstr "The scan produces a review set and never deletes automatically. Inspect the shortest bond and local geometry of each structure. High-pressure structures or unusual bonding systems can have genuinely short distances, so selection alone does not make a structure invalid."
